{
  "title": "Ziyarat of Lady Narjis (s.a.), Mother of Imam al-Mahdi (a.t.f.s.) — Samarra",
  "data": "At the tomb of Lady Narjis (s.a.), behind the grave of Imam al-Hasan al-Askari (a.s.), recite:\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلٰى رَسُوْلِ اللّٰهِ صَلَّى اللّٰهُ عَلَيْهِ وَاٰلِهِ الصَّادِقِ الْاَمِيْنِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAA RASOOLILLAAHI SALLALLAAHU A'LAYHI WA AALIHIS SAADIQIL AMEEN\nPeace be upon Allah’s Messenger, Allah’s blessings be upon him and his Household, the veracious and honest.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلٰى مَوْلَانَا اَمِيْرِ الْمُؤْمِنِيْنَ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAA MAWLAANAA AMEERIL MU'MINEEN\nPeace be upon our master the Commander of the Faithful.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَى الْاَئِمَّةِ الطَّاهِرِيْنَ الْحُجَجِ الْمَيَامِيْنِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAL A'IMMATIT TAAHIREENAL HUJAJIL MAYAAMEEN\nPeace be upon the Immaculate Imams and the blessed Arguments (of Allah).\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلٰى وَالِدَةِ الْاِمَامِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAA WAALIDATIL IMAAM\nPeace be upon the mother of the Imam;\nوَالْمُوْدَعَةِ اَسْرَارَ الْمَلِكِ الْعَلَّامِ\nWAL MOODA'ATI ASRAARAL MALIKIL A'LLAAM\nthe lady entrusted with the secrets of the All-knowing King\nوَالْحَامِلَةِ لِاَشْرَفِ الْاَنَامِ\nWAL HAAMILATI LI-ASHRAFIL ANAAM\nand the bearer of the most honorable of all beings.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكِ اَيَّتُهَا الصِّدِّيْقَةُ الْمَرْضِيَّةُ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKI AYYATUHAS SIDDEEQATUL MARDIYYAH\nPeace be upon you, O veracious and well-pleased lady.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكِ يَا شَبِيْهَةَ اُمِّ مُوْسٰى\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKI YAA SHABEEHATA UMMI MOOSAA\nPeace be upon you, O likeness of the mother of (Prophet) Moses\nوَابْنَةَ حَوَارِيِّ عِيْسٰى\nWABNATA HAWAARIYYI I'EESAA\nand daughter of (Prophet) Jesus’ Disciple.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكِ اَيَّتُهَا التَّقِيَّةُ النَّقِيَّةُ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKI AYYATUHAT TAQIYYATUN NAQIYYAH\nPeace be upon you, O pious and pure.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكِ اَيَّتُهَا الرَّضِيَّةُ الْمَرْضِيَّةُ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKI AYYATUHAR RADIYYATUL MARDIYYAH\nPeace be upon you, O well-pleased and well-contented.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكِ اَيَّتُهَا الْمَنْعُوْتَةُ فِي الْاِنْجِيْلِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKI AYYATUHAL MAN'OOTATU FIL INJEEL\nPeace be upon you, O described in the Gospel,\nالْمَخْطُوْبَةُ مِنْ رُوْحِ اللّٰهِ الْاَمِيْنِ\nAL-MAKHTOOBATU MIN ROOHILLAAHIL AMEEN\nbetrothed from the Honest Spirit of Allah,\nوَمَنْ رَغِبَ فِيْ وُصْلَتِهَا مُحَمَّدٌ سَيِّدُ الْمُرْسَلِيْنَ\nWA MAN RAGHIBA FEE WUSLATIHAA MUHAMMADUN SAYYIDUL MURSALEEN\ndesired for relationship by Muhammad the chief of the Messengers,\nوَالْمُسْتَوْدَعَةُ اَسْرَارَ رَبِّ الْعَالَمِيْنَ\nWAL MUSTAWDA'ATU ASRAARA RABBIL A'ALAMEEN\nand entrusted with the secrets of the Lord of the Worlds.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكِ وَعَلٰىۤ اٰبَاۤئِكِ الْحَوَارِيِّيْنَ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKI WA A'LAA AABAA'IKIL HAWAARIYYEEN\nPeace be upon you and upon your fathers the Disciples.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكِ وَعَلٰى بَعْلِكِ وَوَلَدِكِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKI WA A'LAA BA'LIKI WA WALADIK\nPeace be upon you, your husband, and your son.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكِ وَعَلٰى رُوْحِكِ وَبَدَنِكِ الطَّاهِرِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKI WA A'LAA ROOHIKI WA BADANIKIT TAAHIR\nPeace be upon you and upon your spirit and your pure body.\nاَشْهَدُ اَنَّكِ اَحْسَنْتِ الْكَفَالَةَ\nASH-HADU ANNAKI AHSANTIL KAFAALAH\nI bear witness that you acted excellently in custody (of your son),\nوَاَدَّيْتِ الْاَمَانَةَ\nWA ADDAYTIL AMAANAH\nfulfilled the trust,\nوَاجْتَهَدْتِ فِيْ مَرْضَاةِ اللّٰهِ\nWAJTAHADTI FEE MARDAATILLAAH\nworked painstakingly for gaining Allah’s pleasure,\nوَصَبَرْتِ فِيْ ذَاتِ اللّٰهِ\nWA SABARTI FEE DHAATILLAAH\nacted steadfastly for the sake of Allah,\nوَحَفِظْتِ سِرَّ اللّٰهِ\nWA HAFIZTI SIRRALLAAH\nkept the secret of Allah,\nوَحَمَلْتِ وَلِيَّ اللّٰهِ\nWA HAMALTI WALIYYALLAAH\nbore the representative of Allah,\nوَبَالَغْتِ فِيْ حِفْظِ حُجَّةِ اللّٰهِ\nWA BAALAGHTI FEE HIFZI HUJJATILLAAH\ndid your utmost in safeguarding the Argument of Allah,\nوَرَغِبْتِ فِيْ وُصْلَةِ اَبْنَاۤءِ رَسُوْلِ اللّٰهِ\nWA RAGHIBTI FEE WUSLATI ABNAA'I RASOOLILLAAH\nand desired a bond with the sons of the Messenger of Allah,\nعَارِفَةً بِحَقِّهِمْ مُؤْمِنَةً بِصِدْقِهِمْ\nA'ARIFATAN BIHAQQIHIM MU'MINATAN BISIDQIHIM\nas you had full recognition of their rights, believed in their honesty,\nمُعْتَرِفَةً بِمَنْزِلَتِهِمْ مُسْتَبْصِرَةً بِاَمْرِهِمْ\nMU'TARIFATAN BIMANZILATIHIM MUSTABSIRATAN BI-AMRIHIM\nprofessed their status, had insight into their matter,\nمُشْفِقَةً عَلَيْهِمْ مُؤْثِرَةً هَوَاهُمْ\nMUSHFIQATAN A'LAYHIM MU'THIRATAN HAWAAHUM\nsympathized with them, and preferred their wishes to yours.\nوَاَشْهَدُ اَنَّكِ مَضَيْتِ عَلٰى بَصِيْرَةٍ مِنْ اَمْرِكِ\nWA ASH-HADU ANNAKI MADAYTI A'LAA BASEERATIN MIN AMRIK\nI also bear witness that you passed away with full awareness of your affair,\nمُقْتَدِيَةً بِالصَّالِحِيْنَ\nMUQTADIYATAN BIS SAALIHEEN\nfollowing the examples of the righteous ones,\nرَاضِيَةً مَرْضِيَّةً\nRAADIYATAN MARDIYYAH\nwell-pleased, well-contented,\nتَقِيَّةً نَقِيَّةً زَكِيَّةً\nTAQIYYATAN NAQIYYATAN ZAKIYYAH\npious, pure, and immaculate.\nفَرَضِيَ اللّٰهُ عَنْكِ وَاَرْضَاكِ\nFARADIYALLAAHU A'NKI WA ARDAAK\nSo, may Allah be pleased with you and may He please you\nوَجَعَلَ الْجَنَّةَ مَنْزِلَكِ وَمَاْوَاكِ\nWA JA'ALAL JANNATA MANZILAKI WA MA'WAAK\nand decide Paradise to be your abode and dwelling.\nفَلَقَدْ اَوْلَاكِ مِنَ الْخَيْرَاتِ مَاۤ اَوْلَاكِ\nFALAQAD AWLAAKI MINAL KHAYRAATI MAA AWLAAK\nHe has indeed endowed you with so many good things,\nوَاَعْطَاكِ مِنَ الشَّرَفِ مَا بِهٖ اَغْنَاكِ\nWA A'TAAKI MINASH SHARAFI MAA BIHEE AGHNAAK\nand He has given you the honorable position that made you dispense with everything else.\nفَهَنَّاكِ اللّٰهُ بِمَا مَنَحَكِ مِنَ الْكَرَامَةِ وَاَمْرَاكِ\nFAHANNAAKILLAAHU BIMAA MANAHAKI MINAL KARAAMATI WA AMRAAK\nMay Allah delight and gratify you with the dignity that He has granted you.\nThen raise your head towards the sky and say:\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِيَّاكَ اعْتَمَدْتُ\nALLAAHUMMA IYYAAKA' TAMADT\nO Allah, to You alone have I had recourse.\nوَلِرِضَاكَ طَلَبْتُ\nWA LIRIDAAKA TALABT\nYour pleasure alone have I sought.\nوَبِاَوْلِيَاۤئِكَ اِلَيْكَ تَوَسَّلْتُ\nWA BI-AWLIYAA'IKA ILAYKA TAWASSALT\nThrough Your representatives have I sought means to You.\nوَعَلٰى غُفْرَانِكَ وَحِلْمِكَ اتَّكَلْتُ\nWA A'LAA GHUFRAANIKA WA HILMIKAT TAKALT\nOn Your forgiveness and forbearance have I relied.\nوَبِكَ اعْتَصَمْتُ\nWA BIKA' TASAMT\nBy You alone have I held fast.\nوَبِقَبْرِ اُمِّ وَلِيِّكَ لُذْتُ\nWA BIQABRI UMMI WALIYYIKA LUDHT\nIn the tomb of the mother of Your representative have I taken refuge.\nفَصَلِّ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ وَاٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ\nFASALLI A'LAA MUHAMMADIN WA AALI MUHAMMAD\nSo, (please) send blessings upon Muhammad and Muhammad’s Household,\nوَانْفَعْنِيْ بِزِيَارَتِهَا\nWANFA'NEE BIZIYAARATIHAA\nmake me benefit by my visit to her,\nوَثَبِّتْنِيْ عَلٰى مَحَبَّتِهَا\nWA THABBITNEE A'LAA MAHABBATIHAA\nkeep me firm on love for her,\nوَلَا تَحْرِمْنِيْ شَفَاعَتَهَا وَشَفَاعَةَ وَلَدِهَا\nWA LAA TAHRIMNEE SHAFAA'ATAHAA WA SHAFAA'ATA WALADIHAA\ndo not deprive me of her intercession and her son’s intercession,\nوَارْزُقْنِيْ مُرَافَقَتَهَا\nWARZUQNEE MURAAFAQATAHAA\nprovide me with being in her companionship,\nوَاحْشُرْنِيْ مَعَهَا وَمَعَ وَلَدِهَا\nWAHSHURNEE MA'AHAA WA MA'A WALADIHAA\nand resurrect me with her and with her son,\nكَمَا وَفَّقْتَنِيْ لِزِيَارَةِ وَلَدِهَا وَزِيَارَتِهَا\nKAMAA WAFFAQTANEE LIZIYAARATI WALADIHAA WA ZIYAARATIHAA\nas You have granted me success to visit her son and her.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّيْۤ اَتَوَجَّهُ اِلَيْكَ بِالْاَئِمَّةِ الطَّاهِرِيْنَ\nALLAAHUMMA INNEE ATAWAJJAHU ILAYKA BIL A'IMMATIT TAAHIREEN\nO Allah, I do turn my face towards You by means of the Immaculate Imams,\nوَاَتَوَسَّلُ اِلَيْكَ بِالْحُجَجِ الْمَيَامِيْنِ مِنْ اٰلِ طٰهٰ وَيٰسٓ\nWA ATAWASSALU ILAYKA BIL HUJAJIL MAYAAMEENI MIN AALI TAA HAA WA YAA SEEN\nand I choose as my mediation to You the blessed Arguments from the descendants of Taha and Yasin,\nاَنْ تُصَلِّيَ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ وَاٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ الطَّيِّبِيْنَ\nAN TUSALLIYA A'LAA MUHAMMADIN WA AALI MUHAMMADINIT TAYYIBEEN\n(beseeching You) to bless Muhammad and Muhammad’s Household the pure,\nوَاَنْ تَجْعَلَنِيْ مِنَ الْمُطْمَئِنِّيْنَ\nWA AN TAJ'ALANEE MINAL MUTMA'INNEEN\nand to make me of the tranquil,\nالْفَاۤئِزِيْنَ الْفَرِحِيْنَ الْمُسْتَبْشِرِيْنَ\nAL-FAA'IZEENAL FARIHEENAL MUSTABSHIREEN\ntriumphant, blissful ones who rejoice at good tidings,\nالَّذِيْنَ لَا خَوْفٌ عَلَيْهِمْ وَلَا هُمْ يَحْزَنُوْنَ\nALLADHEENA LAA KHAWFUN A'LAYHIM WA LAA HUM YAHZANOON\non whom there is neither fear nor shall they be aggrieved.\nوَاجْعَلْنِيْ مِمَّنْ قَبِلْتَ سَعْيَهٗ وَيَسَّرْتَ اَمْرَهٗ\nWAJ'ALNEE MIMMAN QABILTA SA'YAHOO WA YASSARTA AMRAH\nAnd (please) make me one of those whose deeds are admitted by You, whose affairs are made easy by You,\nوَكَشَفْتَ ضُرَّهٗ وَاٰمَنْتَ خَوْفَهٗ\nWA KASHAFTA DURRAHOO WA AAMANTA KHAWFAH\nwhose distress is relieved by You, and whose fear is secured by You.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ بِحَقِّ مُحَمَّدٍ وَاٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ\nALLAAHUMMA BIHAQQI MUHAMMADIN WA AALI MUHAMMAD\nO Allah, (I beseech You) in the name of Muhammad and the Household of Muhammad,\nصَلِّ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ وَاٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ\nSALLI A'LAA MUHAMMADIN WA AALI MUHAMMAD\n(please) send blessings upon Muhammad and the Household of Muhammad,\nوَلَا تَجْعَلْهُ اٰخِرَ الْعَهْدِ مِنْ زِيَارَتِيْ اِيَّاهَا\nWA LAA TAJ'ALHU AAKHIRAL A'HDI MIN ZIYAARATEE IYYAAHAA\ndo not decide this visit to be the last time of my visits to her;\nوَارْزُقْنِي الْعَوْدَ اِلَيْهَاۤ اَبَدًا مَاۤ اَبْقَيْتَنِيْ\nWARZUQNIL A'WDA ILAYHAA ABADAN MAA ABQAYTANEE\nrather, endue me with other chances to revisit her as long as You keep me alive.\nوَاِذَا تَوَفَّيْتَنِيْ فَاحْشُرْنِيْ فِيْ زُمْرَتِهَا\nWA IDHAA TAWAFFAYTANEE FAHSHURNEE FEE ZUMRATIHAA\nIf You decide to grasp my soul, then (please) include me with her group,\nوَاَدْخِلْنِيْ فِيْ شَفَاعَةِ وَلَدِهَا وَشَفَاعَتِهَا\nWA ADKHILNEE FEE SHAFAA'ATI WALADIHAA WA SHAFAA'ATIHAA\nbring me in the intercession of her son and her,\nوَاغْفِرْ لِيْ وَلِوَالِدَيَّ وَلِلْمُؤْمِنِيْنَ وَالْمُؤْمِنَاتِ\nWAGHFIR LEE WA LIWAALIDAYYA WA LILMU'MINEENA WAL MU'MINAAT\nforgive me and my parents as well as the believing men and women,\nوَاٰتِنَا فِي الدُّنْيَا حَسَنَةً وَفِي الْاٰخِرَةِ حَسَنَةً\nWA AATINAA FID DUNYAA HASANATAN WA FIL AAKHIRATI HASANAH\ngive us good in this world and good in the Hereafter,\nوَقِنَا بِرَحْمَتِكَ عَذَابَ النَّارِ\nWA QINAA BIRAHMATIKA A'DHAABAN NAAR\nand save us, out of Your mercy, from the chastisement of Fire.\nوَالسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكُمْ يَا سَادَاتِيْ وَرَحْمَةُ اللّٰهِ وَبَرَكَاتُهٗ\nWAS SALAAMU A'LAYKUM YAA SAADAATEE WA RAHMATULLAAHI WA BARAKAATUH\nPeace be upon you all, O my masters. Allah’s mercy and blessings, too, be upon you.",
  "merits": "Lady Narjis (s.a.), the wife of Imam al-Hasan al-Askari (a.s.) and the mother of Imam al-Mahdi (a.t.f.s.), is buried in the shrine at Samarra, behind the tomb of Imam al-Askari (a.s.). Mafatih al-Jinan calls her the lady of this world and the Hereafter, and gives this ziyarat for her tomb, with the supplication that follows it.\n\nHer salutations recall the account of her life that Shaykh al-Saduq records in Kamal al-Din. Her mother descended from Simon (Sham'un), the Disciple and successor of Prophet Jesus (a.s.), so she is greeted as the daughter of Jesus' Disciple. In a dream she saw the Holy Prophet (s.a.w.a.) ask Jesus (a.s.), the Spirit of Allah, for her hand for his son Imam al-Askari (a.s.). And like the mother of Moses (a.s.), she carried her son in secret: no sign of the pregnancy showed until his birth.\n\nOther names given for her are Malika, Sawsan, Rayhana and Sayqal."
}
